ity.com/id/digiron242/", "num_games_owned": 457, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 203, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 203, "last_played": 1728456497, "avatar": "d13b8c92a68d24873149c98c3562698092e2301e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I got this as part of a Humble Bundle and decided to give it a whirl and... damn.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the day, it was a good idea that had a rough execution. the guns play more like serious sam but without any of the impact, the story is practically non-existent, the voiceovers get on your nerves pretty quickly due to reused lines, and in the career there's a sudden spike in difficulty right on the last level, where the AI members of your party are practically worthless\r\n\r\nI'd also like to point out it's a rare achievement to even OPEN the game. That right kids, as of time of writing, less than 10% of people even bothered after seeing the cover art or getting it in the same/a similar bundle to what I got\r\n\r\nI will say it does have nice environment art and better than average enemy designs though", "timestamp_created": 1728456751, "timestamp_updated": 1728456751, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471391797065734863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176403279", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059804297", "personaname": "Tax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198059804297/", "num_games_owned": 417, "num_reviews": 272, "playtime_forever": 137, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 137, "last_played": 1653884634, "avatar": "de3125f2d5ede8cf56b4747bd42df80c70d65326"}, "language": "english", "review": "Left 4 Dead in space. Still has a way to go, but what is here is good.", "timestamp_created": 1